@startuml
' Figure 48.4  Agents that hire agents
' Reading order: top to bottom. A traveler's flight moves (cap $400);
' Lakeshore's rebooking agent asks the policy engine for a narrower
' mandate, hires the partner's hotel agent with it, and the
' partner's agent may only narrow it again. A mandate that widens is
' refused. Lakeshore's verifier reads the hotel's signed folio, not
' the partner agent's reply. From plan/data/hire.toml.
!include plantuml-theme.puml
participant "Agent" as A <<ops>>
participant "Policy" as P <<policy>>
participant "Partner" as H <<ops>>
participant "Verifier" as V <<ops>>
A -> P : Mandate?
P -> A : $180, 30 min
A -> H : Task
H -[$POLICY]> P : Wider?
P -[$POLICY]> H : Refused
H -> A : Moved
V -> V : Read folio
V -> A : Verified
@enduml
